<p><strong>Paul John Brilliance is the unpeated expression in a family that also includes lightly peated and more heavily peated whiskies.</strong> A shopper searching only for “Paul John” could see Brilliance, Edited, Bold or Nirvana, each with its own label and flavour direction. Brilliance is made in Goa and is presented by its producer as an Indian single malt. “Unpeated” is the useful word here; it does not mean the whisky has no flavour or has never touched oak.</p>
